sequenceDiagram
    autonumber

    actor Parent
    actor Child
    participant App as Flutter App
    participant Auth as Firebase Authentication
    participant API as Callable Cloud Functions
    participant DB as Cloud Firestore
    participant Cache as Firestore Cache and Local Store

    rect rgb(18, 19, 18)
        Note over Parent,DB: Parent account and family setup
        Parent->>App: Register with email and password
        App->>Auth: Create account
        Auth-->>App: Session and verification state
        Parent->>App: Verify email and accept privacy terms
        App->>API: Complete onboarding with consent version
        API->>DB: Transactionally create parent profile and consent
        DB-->>API: Parent onboarding completed
        API-->>App: Continue to child setup

        Parent->>App: Enter child name, age band, language and avatar
        App->>API: Create child profile
        API->>DB: Verify parent and create child with initial skills
        DB-->>API: Child and starter recommendations
        API-->>App: Child profile created and selected
        App->>Cache: Store active child reference
    end

    rect rgb(60, 56, 47)
        Note over Child,DB: Daily learning journey
        Child->>App: Open Curio
        App->>Cache: Load active child and cached home summary
        App->>DB: Read authorized home summary and assignments
        DB-->>App: Streak, XP, companion, mastery and recommendations
        App->>Cache: Cache authoritative summary
        App-->>Child: Show recommended activity

        Child->>App: Start activity
        App->>API: Request activity instance with request ID
        API->>DB: Verify ownership and select published content version
        API->>DB: Create or resume learning session
        DB-->>API: Session and protected activity payload
        API-->>App: Questions without protected answers
        App->>Cache: Persist activity and session state

        loop Each question or story choice
            Child->>App: Submit response
            App->>Cache: Save pending response with idempotency key
            App->>API: Validate response
        API->>DB: Transactionally reject duplicate requests
        API->>DB: Validate response and update session progress
            DB-->>API: Feedback, hint and mastery delta
            API-->>App: Authoritative response result
            App->>Cache: Mark response synchronized
            App-->>Child: Explain result and show next step
        end

        Child->>App: Complete activity
        App->>API: Finalize session
        API->>DB: Validate completion and award rewards atomically
        DB-->>API: XP, streak, mastery and next recommendation
        API-->>App: Completion summary
        App->>Cache: Store final state
        App-->>Child: Show celebration and learning recap
    end

    rect rgb(29, 24, 45)
        Note over Parent,DB: Parent insight
        Parent->>App: Unlock parent area with PIN
        App->>DB: Request selected child's progress summary
        DB-->>App: Trends, effort, strengths and misconceptions
        App-->>Parent: Display parent dashboard
    end
